              "text": "ਔਟਣਾ (auṭṇā) is inherited from Sanskrit āvartayati, \"causes to turn round\" (the entry also gives āvartana, \"stirring\"); CDIAL lists Punjabi auṭṇā, \"to boil\", and Hindi auṭnā, \"to boil, to evaporate over a fire\" (CDIAL 1420)."
